* Pi by Machin's formula: pi/4 = 4·arctan(1/5) - arctan(1/239).
* Eight terms of each series give pi to eight places.
* Part 1 adds one term of the series z - z*3/3 + z*5/5 - ... to t.
1.1 Set t = t + g·z*k/k.
1.2 Set g = -g.

* Part 2 is the whole series for one z.
2.1 Set t = 0.
2.2 Set g = 1.
2.3 Do part 1 for k = 1(2)15.

Set z = 1/5.
Do part 2.
Set u = t.
Set z = 1/239.
Do part 2.
Type 16·u - 4·t.
